WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.038 --> 00:00:02.774
Carlson, Mccarthy is risking

00:00:03.175 --> 00:00:03.508
considerable considerable public

00:00:03.642 --> 00:00:06.144
backlash.

00:00:06.278 --> 00:00:07.713
Republican house speaker Kevin

00:00:07.846 --> 00:00:09.181
Mccarthy tonight defending his

00:00:09.181 --> 00:00:10.582
decision to give thousands of

00:00:10.716 --> 00:00:12.484
hours of security footage of the

00:00:12.618 --> 00:00:15.187
January 6th attack on the

00:00:15.187 --> 00:00:17.789
capitol exclusively to tucker

00:00:17.923 --> 00:00:18.123
Carlson.

00:00:18.257 --> 00:00:18.857
Most of the video never seen by

00:00:19.191 --> 00:00:20.626
the public.

00:00:20.759 --> 00:00:22.261
Mccarthy telling "The New York

00:00:22.394 --> 00:00:23.962
Times," quote, they do belong to

00:00:24.096 --> 00:00:25.664
the American public.

00:00:25.797 --> 00:00:26.698
I think sunshine lets everybody

00:00:26.832 --> 00:00:28.533
make their own judgment.

00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:29.902
But media watchers are concerned

00:00:30.035 --> 00:00:31.637
about how Carlson might handle

00:00:31.770 --> 00:00:32.237
the footage.

00:00:32.371 --> 00:00:33.372
&gt;&gt; He's giving it to somebody

00:00:33.505 --> 00:00:35.440
who has been perhaps the chief

00:00:35.574 --> 00:00:37.276
propagator on fox and one of the

00:00:37.409 --> 00:00:39.845
nation's leading propagators of

00:00:39.978 --> 00:00:41.513
conspiracy theories and baseless

00:00:41.647 --> 00:00:42.714
claims about what happened on

00:00:42.848 --> 00:00:43.749
January 6th.

00:00:43.882 --> 00:00:46.418
&gt;&gt; It's just like every hour --

00:00:46.551 --> 00:00:47.653
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Carlson has

00:00:47.786 --> 00:00:50.756
downplayed the seriousness of

00:00:50.889 --> 00:00:51.623
the January 6th insurrection and

00:00:51.757 --> 00:00:53.225
made false claims like this on

00:00:53.225 --> 00:00:54.493
his fox show.

00:00:54.626 --> 00:00:57.462
&gt;&gt; So FBI operatives were

00:00:57.596 --> 00:00:59.698
organizing the attack on the

00:00:59.831 --> 00:01:01.700
capitol on January 6th according

00:01:01.833 --> 00:01:02.601
to government documents.

00:01:02.734 --> 00:01:04.202
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Top Democrats are

00:01:04.336 --> 00:01:05.270
furious over Mccarthy's granting

00:01:05.404 --> 00:01:07.239
of the footage to Carlson.

00:01:07.239 --> 00:01:08.774
Senate majority leader chuck

00:01:08.907 --> 00:01:10.242
Schumer telling colleagues in a

00:01:10.375 --> 00:01:12.511
letter that it, quote, poses

00:01:12.644 --> 00:01:14.112
grave security risks to members

00:01:14.246 --> 00:01:15.247
of congress and everyone who

00:01:15.247 --> 00:01:16.581
works on capitol hill but in

00:01:16.715 --> 00:01:17.950
defending the move Mccarthy also

00:01:18.083 --> 00:01:19.851
told "The times" he had, quote,

00:01:19.985 --> 00:01:21.486
promised to release the footage.

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:22.621
Mccarthy did indeed promise to

00:01:22.754 --> 00:01:24.723
release the video as part of his

00:01:24.856 --> 00:01:25.457
contentious bid to become house

00:01:25.590 --> 00:01:27.326
speaker.

00:01:27.492 --> 00:01:30.162
A GOP source tells CNN,

00:01:30.295 --> 00:01:31.263
conservative Republican

00:01:31.263 --> 00:01:33.365
congressman and trump supporter

00:01:33.498 --> 00:01:34.800
Matt Gaetz had specifically

00:01:34.933 --> 00:01:36.501
demanded the footage be released

00:01:36.635 --> 00:01:37.803
as a condition of supporting

00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:39.404
Mccarthy's speakership bid but

00:01:39.538 --> 00:01:41.273
that Gaetz did not demand that

00:01:41.273 --> 00:01:43.275
the footage be given to tucker

00:01:43.408 --> 00:01:43.608
Carlson.

00:01:43.742 --> 00:01:45.277
That was decided later.

00:01:45.277 --> 00:01:47.713
&gt;&gt; It's a sign of the speaker's

00:01:47.846 --> 00:01:48.613
precarious political situation,

00:01:48.747 --> 00:01:49.948
that he feels that he needs to

00:01:50.082 --> 00:01:51.616
do this, that he's trying to win

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:53.285
over some of the hard right

00:01:53.285 --> 00:01:54.486
elements of his party while also

00:01:54.619 --> 00:01:56.521
holding power and holding on to

00:01:56.655 --> 00:01:57.289
the speakership.

00:01:57.289 --> 00:01:58.690
&gt;&gt; Reporter: We reached out to

00:01:58.824 --> 00:01:59.691
tucker Carlson and Fox News and

00:01:59.825 --> 00:02:01.293
asked how they plan to handle

00:02:01.293 --> 00:02:02.094
the January 6th footage.

00:02:02.227 --> 00:02:04.763
We haven't heard back.

00:02:04.896 --> 00:02:06.965
According to the "The New York

00:02:07.299 --> 00:02:08.166
Times," after tucker Carlson

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:10.135
does whatever he does with the

00:02:10.268 --> 00:02:11.536
footage Kevin Mccarthy has said

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:13.805
he might make the footage more

00:02:13.939 --> 00:02:14.573
widely available possibly to

00:02:14.706 --> 00:02:16.108
other media outlets, wolf.

00:02:16.241 --> 00:02:17.609
&gt;&gt; All right, we shall see,

00:02:17.743 --> 00:02:19.311
thanks very much, Brian Todd

00:02:19.311 --> 00:02:19.845
reporting for us.

00:02:19.978 --> 00:02:22.014
We're joined by two former

00:02:22.147 --> 00:02:25.550
members of congress who are now

00:02:25.684 --> 00:02:27.619
CNN political commentators.

00:02:27.753 --> 00:02:29.321
Adam Kinzinger and mondaire

00:02:29.354 --> 00:02:29.621
Jones.

00:02:29.755 --> 00:02:31.323
Adam, as someone who worked on

00:02:31.323 --> 00:02:32.891
the select committee

00:02:33.325 --> 00:02:33.959
investigating January 6th, the

00:02:34.092 --> 00:02:35.460
insurrection, what do you make

00:02:35.594 --> 00:02:37.329
of speaker Mccarthy outsourcing

00:02:37.462 --> 00:02:39.398
this video now, very sensitive

00:02:39.531 --> 00:02:41.500
video, thousands of hours to fox

00:02:41.633 --> 00:02:41.800
News?

00:02:41.933 --> 00:02:43.969
&gt;&gt; Well, look, it's one thing

00:02:44.102 --> 00:02:45.871
Fox News which would have been

00:02:46.004 --> 00:02:47.672
wrong, it's another thing tucker

00:02:47.806 --> 00:02:48.774
Carlson, tucker has been the

00:02:48.907 --> 00:02:51.343
chief of the conspiracy

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:53.345
theories, yes, it poses a

00:02:53.445 --> 00:02:54.613
danger.

00:02:54.746 --> 00:02:56.581
Secondarily this can feed

00:02:56.715 --> 00:02:58.083
conspiracy theories, so there is

00:02:58.216 --> 00:02:59.651
an old conspiracy theory where

00:02:59.785 --> 00:03:01.987
you see a rioter try to open a

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:03.555
door and it's a fire door.

00:03:03.688 --> 00:03:04.656
They're actually difficult to

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:06.758
open and he looks up and gets

00:03:06.892 --> 00:03:08.360
off camera direction from

00:03:08.493 --> 00:03:09.828
somebody who had opened a fire

00:03:09.961 --> 00:03:11.363
door and then he opens the door

00:03:11.363 --> 00:03:12.798
because they told him how to do

00:03:12.931 --> 00:03:13.365
it.

00:03:13.365 --> 00:03:14.833
That turned into a conspiracy,

00:03:14.966 --> 00:03:16.435
by the way, that actually he's

00:03:16.568 --> 00:03:18.003
looking up at some control panel

00:03:18.136 --> 00:03:20.439
or at some camera where there's

00:03:20.572 --> 00:03:21.973
some officer at a control panel

00:03:22.107 --> 00:03:24.709
but then buzzed him in,

00:03:24.843 --> 00:03:26.078
completely garbage and untrue

00:03:26.211 --> 00:03:27.379
but that's what you can do when

00:03:27.446 --> 00:03:29.014
you selectively take pieces of

00:03:29.381 --> 00:03:31.049
the video so I either expect

00:03:31.383 --> 00:03:32.184
tucker Carlson to selectively

00:03:32.317 --> 00:03:33.718
take pieces that can be -- you

00:03:33.852 --> 00:03:35.387
can make up questions with it

00:03:35.454 --> 00:03:36.655
because always just asking

00:03:36.788 --> 00:03:38.123
questions or secondarily if you

00:03:38.256 --> 00:03:39.491
don't hear anything from him, of

00:03:39.624 --> 00:03:40.959
course, it proves that it is

00:03:41.393 --> 00:03:41.660
exactly what everybody knows

00:03:41.793 --> 00:03:43.929
January 6th was.

00:03:44.062 --> 00:03:46.064
&gt;&gt; Mondaire, Mccarthy said these

00:03:46.198 --> 00:03:48.066
tapes and I'm quoting him now

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:49.401
belong to the American public.

00:03:49.401 --> 00:03:51.069
Is the American public going to

00:03:51.403 --> 00:03:52.671
get an objective look at these

00:03:52.804 --> 00:03:55.974
tapes from tucker Carlson?

00:03:56.108 --> 00:03:56.641
&gt;&gt; Certainly not.

00:03:56.775 --> 00:03:59.411
In fact, "The New York Times"

00:03:59.444 --> 00:04:01.613
reported recently that according

00:04:01.746 --> 00:04:04.583
to the dominion lawsuit that

00:04:04.716 --> 00:04:06.151
voting machine lawsuit that

00:04:06.284 --> 00:04:08.019
tucker Carlson was sending text

00:04:08.153 --> 00:04:10.889
messages in which he raised

00:04:11.022 --> 00:04:12.958
serious doubts about the

00:04:13.091 --> 00:04:14.226
truthfulness of people like Rudy

00:04:14.359 --> 00:04:16.995
Giuliani and others who were

00:04:17.429 --> 00:04:19.531
raising baseless claims about

00:04:19.664 --> 00:04:20.832
the election in 2020.

00:04:20.966 --> 00:04:24.503
We also know that in is someone

00:04:24.636 --> 00:04:26.104
who immediately after January

00:04:26.271 --> 00:04:29.074
6th took place pivoted to

00:04:29.441 --> 00:04:31.443
conspiracy theories like antifa

00:04:31.443 --> 00:04:35.447
caused it and so many other,

00:04:35.447 --> 00:04:36.848
again, patently false, you know,

00:04:36.982 --> 00:04:38.316
theories about what caused it,

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:39.784
so this is not someone who has

00:04:39.918 --> 00:04:40.886
an interest in telling the

00:04:41.019 --> 00:04:41.453
truth.

00:04:41.453 --> 00:04:42.787
This is someone who is an

00:04:42.921 --> 00:04:44.356
extension of the Republican

00:04:44.489 --> 00:04:45.123
party's propaganda machine when

00:04:45.457 --> 00:04:47.459
it comes to January 6th and we

00:04:47.492 --> 00:04:48.493
should expect nothing else

00:04:48.627 --> 00:04:50.695
coming from this guy than that.

00:04:50.829 --> 00:04:52.397
&gt;&gt; Adam, are there political

00:04:52.531 --> 00:04:55.467
risks for this move, political

00:04:55.467 --> 00:04:58.803
risks that this move potentially

00:04:58.937 --> 00:04:59.471
gets for Mccarthy?

00:04:59.604 --> 00:05:02.574
&gt;&gt; Yeah, I mean he's got his

00:05:02.707 --> 00:05:03.542
internal political risks.

00:05:03.675 --> 00:05:05.043
I don't think this will take him

00:05:05.477 --> 00:05:06.278
down because, again, basically

00:05:06.411 --> 00:05:07.546
everybody voted for Mccarthy and

00:05:07.679 --> 00:05:09.481
one of the issues with the

00:05:09.481 --> 00:05:10.949
moderates and so-called

00:05:11.082 --> 00:05:12.484
moderates of the GOP of which I

00:05:12.617 --> 00:05:14.619
was one is, you know, a lot of

00:05:14.753 --> 00:05:16.021
imtoos you like to work as a

00:05:16.154 --> 00:05:16.555
team.

00:05:16.688 --> 00:05:18.223
They don't really want to stand

00:05:18.356 --> 00:05:19.891
up and overthrow the speaker

00:05:20.025 --> 00:05:21.593
like the freedom club often does

00:05:21.726 --> 00:05:23.628
so there's -- it's like a

00:05:23.762 --> 00:05:24.196
cumulative risk.

00:05:24.329 --> 00:05:25.564
The more he does this, the more

00:05:25.697 --> 00:05:26.831
you're going to start seeing

00:05:26.965 --> 00:05:28.934
people within the so-called

00:05:29.067 --> 00:05:30.402
moderates outraged about it.

00:05:30.535 --> 00:05:31.636
Obviously the American people

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:33.505
have got to be looking at this

00:05:33.505 --> 00:05:35.507
and short of just tucker

00:05:35.507 --> 00:05:36.107
Carlson's audience have been

00:05:36.241 --> 00:05:37.509
looking at this going, what in

00:05:37.609 --> 00:05:38.777
the world was he thinking and

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:39.911
let me say it's going to be one

00:05:40.045 --> 00:05:40.845
of two things.

00:05:40.979 --> 00:05:43.515
Either he did make a promise to

00:05:43.582 --> 00:05:44.749
tucker Carlson or if as the

00:05:44.883 --> 00:05:45.650
reporting suggests it was just

00:05:45.784 --> 00:05:46.985
to release it then Kevin

00:05:47.118 --> 00:05:49.521
Mccarthy did this politically

00:05:49.621 --> 00:05:50.989
calculated to both garner favor

00:05:51.122 --> 00:05:54.526
with tucker Carlson and/or have

00:05:54.659 --> 00:05:57.062
him on speed dial because behind

00:05:57.195 --> 00:05:57.862
the scenes Kevin Mccarthy just

00:05:57.996 --> 00:05:59.564
about every meeting you're in

00:05:59.698 --> 00:06:01.666
with him talks about someone

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:03.702
famous he talked to so now if he

00:06:03.835 --> 00:06:05.570
can have tucker Carlson's ear

00:06:05.704 --> 00:06:06.905
that will impress a lot of

00:06:07.038 --> 00:06:07.973
Republicans when he's meeting

00:06:08.106 --> 00:06:08.373
with them.

00:06:08.506 --> 00:06:09.841
&gt;&gt; Mondaire, what does it tell

00:06:09.975 --> 00:06:11.543
you Mccarthy has already been

00:06:11.576 --> 00:06:12.978
fund-raising off of this

00:06:13.111 --> 00:06:15.213
decision to release these

00:06:15.547 --> 00:06:18.316
videotapes to tucker Carlson?

00:06:18.450 --> 00:06:20.018
&gt;&gt; Kevin Mccarthy has gone full

00:06:20.151 --> 00:06:22.520
Maga to the extent anyone was

00:06:22.654 --> 00:06:25.657
under any illusion that Kevin

00:06:25.790 --> 00:06:28.660
Mccarthy would be able to be a

00:06:28.793 --> 00:06:30.028
