00:06:33.198 --> 00:06:34.866
some semblance of reasonableness

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:36.701
or integrity for that matter,

00:06:36.835 --> 00:06:38.570
then I think they've been

00:06:38.703 --> 00:06:40.538
disabused of that time and time

00:06:40.672 --> 00:06:42.240
again, you know, it was just a

00:06:42.374 --> 00:06:43.642
few weeks ago that Kevin

00:06:43.775 --> 00:06:44.876
Mccarthy was doing interviews in

00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:47.712
which he said that he had not

00:06:47.846 --> 00:06:51.216
