00:06:51.583 --> 00:06:53.585
Gaetz and others denying him the

00:06:53.718 --> 00:06:54.919
speakership so here we learn

00:06:55.053 --> 00:06:56.154
that this was one of several

00:06:56.288 --> 00:06:57.856
things that he promised and he's

00:06:57.989 --> 00:06:59.591
following through on that

00:06:59.591 --> 00:07:00.625
promise, he's doing it, by the

00:07:00.759 --> 00:07:02.193
way, to the detriment of the

00:07:02.327 --> 00:07:04.429
safety of hundreds of members of

00:07:04.562 --> 00:07:05.830
congress and thousands of staff

00:07:05.964 --> 00:07:07.799
persons who work on the hill who

00:07:07.932 --> 00:07:11.036
nearly died on January 6th in

00:07:11.169 --> 00:07:12.237
2021 and who now are going to

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:14.105
see their lives put at risk

